OL,7,FWarning: This article contains
OL,8,Freferences to sexual assault that
OL,9,Freaders may find distressing.
OL,11,FA university has been criticised after
OL,12,Fanonymous posts about sexual assault
OL,13,Fand misogyny were made by a student-run
OL,14,F"banter" account it followed.
OL,16,FCardiff University has since unfollowed
OL,17,Fthe Cardiff Uni Banter Instagram
OL,18,Faccount after students raised concerns
OL,19,Fabout the material being posted.
